            <ArticleTitle>Disabling complications following inadvertent overextension of a root canal filling material.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>135-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of pain and paresthesia of the mental nerve following inadvertent introduction of root canal filling material into the inferior alveolar nerve canal is described. The causes and treatments of this disabling complication are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
